# Platform gateway (`apps/marketing`)

Apex and `www` hosts on `PLATFORM_ROOT_DOMAIN` render the **platform mother site** — not club catalog bootstrap.

## Host detection

| Host pattern | `isPlatformMotherHost` |
|--------------|--------------------------|
| `{root}` (apex) | true |
| `www.{root}` | true |
| `{club}.{root}` | false (club marketing unchanged) |
| `admin.{root}` | false |

Parser: `@app-tour/tenant-kernel` `parseMultiLevelTenantHost`.

## Surfaces

| Route | Mother host | Club host |
|-------|-------------|-----------|
| `/` | Gateway home + Super Admin CTA | Existing catalog home |
| `/pricing` · `/about` · `/contact` | Maintenance stub | `notFound()` — **page** 404 (`catalog.pageNotFound` / `app/not-found.tsx`). Do not publish club about/pricing/contact pages. Tour unpublished stays on `app/tours/[tourId]/not-found.tsx` (`catalog.notFound`). |
| `/tours/*` | unchanged routes (mother layout has no tours CTA on `/`) | Club catalog |

Super Admin URL: `https://admin.{PLATFORM_ROOT_DOMAIN}` via `buildPlatformAdminUrl()`.

## Layout branch

`apps/marketing/app/layout.tsx` — when mother host: `PlatformMotherShell` only (no tenant branding fetch). Club path unchanged.

## Env

| Variable | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| `PLATFORM_ROOT_DOMAIN` | Root domain (default `localhost`) |

API `/public/tenant-context` on apex remains **404** — correct; no API changes in P2-A.
